WEBVTT

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:01.018
People think they have to ask
for exactly what they want,

00:06:01.042 --> 00:06:02.601
but that's not what Grace did.

00:06:02.625 --> 00:06:04.792
She put multiple counters on the table.

00:06:05.583 --> 00:06:08.226
GS: I think I anchored
with three different numbers.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:10.333
So in a way, it was a range.

00:06:11.309 --> 00:06:13.309
AG: This strategy felt friendlier to Grace

00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:15.518
than coming in with a hardball demand,

00:06:15.542 --> 00:06:18.601
and it's actually been demonstrated
to get better results.

00:06:18.625 --> 00:06:23.226
Let's say you're negotiating your salary
and your target is 60,000 dollars.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.351
Instead of anchoring there,
experiments show

00:06:25.375 --> 00:06:29.042
that you're better off asking
for a range of 60,000 to 65,000.